msgstr "El chat en www.example.com"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid "Attach it to this LLMClient"
msgstr "Vincúlala a este LLMClient"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid "Create the api key"
msgstr "Crear la clave de API"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid "Choose its api key"
msgstr "Elige su clave de API"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid "Copy its secret now"
msgstr "Copia su secreto ahora"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid ""
"This is the secret of %(name)s. Smarter keeps only a hash of it, and can't "
"show it again: store it somewhere safe, such as a password manager or your "
"hosting's secrets. It is what your front end sends, in place of %"
"(placeholder)s."
msgstr ""
"Este es el secreto de %(name)s. Smarter solo guarda un hash de él y no puede "
"mostrarlo de nuevo: guárdalo en un lugar seguro, como un gestor de "
"contraseñas o los secretos de tu hosting. Es lo que envía tu front end, en "
"lugar de %(placeholder)s."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid "Your account's api keys"
msgstr "Las claves de API de tu cuenta"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid "Last used"
msgstr "Último uso"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid "Never"
msgstr "Nunca"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid "Attached"
msgstr "Vinculada"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid "Attach"
msgstr "Vincular"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid "There are no api keys that you can manage yet."
msgstr "Todavía no hay claves de API que puedas gestionar."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/lib/messages.ts
msgid ""
"Only the LLMClient's owner, or an account admin, can change its api key."
msgstr ""
"Solo el propietario del LLMClient, o un administrador de la cuenta, puede "
"cambiar su clave de API."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid "Create an api key"
msgstr "Crea una clave de API"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid ""
"The key is yours. Its secret is shown once, right after you create it. The "
"web console's API Keys page lists your keys, and turns a key off without "
"deleting it."
msgstr ""
"La clave es tuya. Su secreto se muestra una sola vez, justo después de "
"crearla. La página Claves de API de la consola web lista tus claves, y "
"desactiva una clave sin eliminarla."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-list/src/components/CardView/Component.tsx
msgid "API Keys"
msgstr "Claves de API"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid ""
"Only an account admin can create api keys. Ask one to create a key for you, "
"then attach it here, or ask them to run:"
msgstr ""
"Solo un administrador de la cuenta puede crear claves de API. Pídele a uno "
"que cree una clave para ti y luego vincúlala aquí, o pídele que ejecute:"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid "Conversations"
msgstr "Conversaciones"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid "Chat sessions"
msgstr "Sesiones de chat"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid ""
"Every conversation with %(app_name)s is a chat session, which the platform "
"identifies by a session key. The session's messages are stored on the "
"platform, so a conversation survives a page reload, or a visit to another "
"page: the chat sends its key, and the platform answers with the conversation "
"so far."
msgstr ""
"Cada conversación con %(app_name)s es una sesión de chat, que la plataforma "
"identifica con una clave de sesión. Los mensajes de la sesión se guardan en "
"la plataforma, así que una conversación sobrevive a una recarga de la "
"página, o a una visita a otra página: el chat envía su clave, y la "
"plataforma responde con la conversación hasta ese momento."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid "The platform makes it"
msgstr "La plataforma la crea"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid ""
"The first %(config)s request of a chat that has no key gets a new one, 64 "
"hexadecimal characters, in the response's %(field)s. Don't make up your own: "
"the platform checks its format."
msgstr ""
"La primera solicitud %(config)s de un chat que no tiene clave recibe una "
"nueva, de 64 caracteres hexadecimales, en el campo %(field)s de la "
"respuesta. No inventes la tuya: la plataforma comprueba su formato."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid "The client keeps it"
msgstr "El cliente la guarda"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid ""
"The key is all that the client stores: the browser, or your own server. The "
"session's messages, and the platform's records of its tool calls and costs, "
"stay on the platform."
msgstr ""
"La clave es lo único que guarda el cliente: el navegador, o tu propio "
"servidor. Los mensajes de la sesión, y los registros de la plataforma de sus "
"llamadas a herramientas y sus costos, se quedan en la plataforma."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid "Forgetting it starts over"
msgstr "Olvidarla empieza de nuevo"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid ""
"A %(config)s request without a key starts a new session, with a new key. "
"That is all that Smarter Chat's New chat button does."
msgstr ""
"Una solicitud %(config)s sin clave inicia una sesión nueva, con una clave "
"nueva. Eso es todo lo que hace el botón de chat nuevo de Smarter Chat."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid "Smarter Chat does it for you"
msgstr "Smarter Chat lo hace por ti"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid ""
"Smarter Chat keeps the key in a cookie, %(cookie)s by default, for one day, "
"and for the page's path, so that each page has its own conversation. Set %"
"(cookie_path)s to %(root)s to keep one conversation as the visitor moves "
"from page to page. The embed script keeps its own cookie, for the whole site."
msgstr ""
"Smarter Chat guarda la clave en una cookie, %(cookie)s por defecto, durante "
"un día, y para la ruta de la página, de modo que cada página tiene su propia "
"conversación. Pon %(cookie_path)s en %(root)s para mantener una sola "
"conversación mientras el visitante pasa de una página a otra. El script de "
"inserción guarda su propia cookie, para todo el sitio."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid ""
"The WordPress, Drupal and Shopify integrations, and the html snippet, use "
"Smarter Chat, so they need nothing more."
msgstr ""
"Las integraciones de WordPress, Drupal y Shopify, y el fragmento de html, "
"usan Smarter Chat, así que no necesitan nada más."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid "In your own front end"
msgstr "En tu propio front end"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid "Start a session"
msgstr "Inicia una sesión"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid ""
"Send %(config)s with no key, as the first command in How this url works "
"does. Its response's %(field)s is the new session's key."
msgstr ""
"Envía %(config)s sin clave, como hace el primer comando de Cómo funciona "
"esta url. El campo %(field)s de su respuesta es la clave de la sesión nueva."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid "Keep the key"
msgstr "Guarda la clave"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid ""
"In the browser, in localStorage or a cookie. In a server-to-server "
"integration, in your own database, beside your user, so that each of your "
"users has their own conversation."
msgstr ""
"En el navegador, en localStorage o en una cookie. En una integración de "
"servidor a servidor, en tu propia base de datos, junto a tu usuario, para "
"que cada uno de tus usuarios tenga su propia conversación."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid "Send it with every prompt"
msgstr "Envíala con cada prompt"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid ""
"Add it to the body, as %(field)s. The request still carries the whole "
"conversation, in %(messages)s, and the platform adds the new messages to the "
"session."
msgstr ""
"Agrégala al cuerpo, como %(field)s. La solicitud sigue llevando toda la "
"conversación, en %(messages)s, y la plataforma agrega los mensajes nuevos a "
"la sesión."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid "Come back to it"
msgstr "Vuelve a ella"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid ""
"After a reload, send %(config)s with the key. Its response's %(history)s is "
"the conversation so far, to display again, and its %(field)s is the same key."
msgstr ""
"Después de una recarga, envía %(config)s con la clave. El campo %(history)s "
"de su respuesta es la conversación hasta ese momento, para mostrarla de "
"nuevo, y su %(field)s es la misma clave."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid "Keep a session key private"
msgstr "Mantén privada la clave de sesión"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid ""
"Anyone who has a session key, and can call this url, can read its "
"conversation, with the %(config)s request above. Don't put it in a url that "
"people share, in a log, or in an analytics event. It doesn't authenticate "
"the caller: an api key does that."
msgstr ""
"Cualquiera que tenga una clave de sesión, y pueda llamar a esta url, puede "
"leer su conversación, con la solicitud %(config)s de arriba. No la pongas en "
"una url que la gente comparta, en un registro ni en un evento de analítica. "
"No autentica a quien llama: eso lo hace una clave de API."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/CopyButton.tsx, react/packages/smarter-prompt-passthrough/src/components/ServerLogs/Component.tsx, react/packages/smarter-workbench/src/components/Console/ServerLogs.tsx
msgid "Copied"
msgstr "Copiado"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/CopyButton.tsx
msgid "Copy"
msgstr "Copiar"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-list/src/components/CardView/Component.tsx, react/packages/smarter-vectorstore-list/src/components/CardView/Component.tsx
msgid "Deployed"
msgstr "Implementado"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx, react/packages/smarter-prompt-passthrough/src/components/LLMProviderPassthroughRequest/Component.tsx, react/packages/smarter-prompt-passthrough/src/components/LLMProviderSelector/Component.tsx
msgid "LLM provider"
msgstr "Proveedor de LLM"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-list/src/components/CardView/Component.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-list/src/components/ListView/Component.tsx, react/packages/smarter-prompt-passthrough/src/components/LLMProviderPassthroughResponse/ResponseSummary.tsx
msgid "Model"
msgstr "Modelo"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx
msgid "Access"
msgstr "Acceso"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx
msgid "Api key required"
msgstr "Requiere clave de API"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx
msgid "Public"
msgstr "Pública"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx
msgid "This LLMClient"
msgstr "Este LLMClient"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx
msgid ""
"Every request needs one of this LLMClient's api keys. A key that is in a web "
"page is public: give each site a key of its own, and revoke it if it is "
"abused."
msgstr ""
"Cada solicitud necesita una de las claves de API de este LLMClient. Una "
"clave que está en una página web es pública: da a cada sitio su propia "
"clave, y revócala si se abusa de ella."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx
msgid ""
"Anyone who has this url can chat with it, and every prompt is charged to its "
"owner. Attach an api key to require one, or give it a budget."
msgstr ""
"Cualquiera que tenga esta url puede chatear con él, y cada prompt se cobra a "
"su propietario. Vincula una clave de API para exigirla, o asígnale un "
"presupuesto."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid "Need to secure this url?"
msgstr "¿Necesitas proteger esta url?"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx
msgid "Live"
msgstr "En línea"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx
msgid "Not deployed yet"
msgstr "Aún no implementado"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx
msgid ""
"%(app_name)s is live. Its system prompt, its LLM and its tools now answer at "
"its own url:"
msgstr ""
"%(app_name)s está en línea. Su prompt de sistema, su LLM y sus herramientas "
"ahora responden en su propia url:"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx
msgid ""
"%(app_name)s works here, in the workbench, but nobody else can reach it yet. "
"Deploy it, and it gets its own url, with its own TLS certificate:"
msgstr ""
"%(app_name)s funciona aquí, en el área de trabajo, pero nadie más puede "
"acceder a él todavía. Impleméntalo y tendrá su propia url, con su propio "
"certificado TLS:"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx
msgid ""
"This url is an api, not a web page. It is the backend of Smarter Chat, the "
"chat window of the workbench, which is also the %(package)s npm package. Put "
"Smarter Chat on a web page, point it at this url, and your visitors are "
"talking to %(app_name)s."
msgstr ""
"Esta url es una api, no una página web. Es el backend de Smarter Chat, la "
"ventana de chat del área de trabajo, que también es el paquete npm %"
"(package)s. Pon Smarter Chat en una página web, apúntalo a esta url, y tus "
"visitantes estarán hablando con %(app_name)s."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx
msgid "Deploy it with the smarter cli:"
msgstr "Impleméntalo con el cli de smarter:"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx
msgid ""
"Smarter then creates its host and its TLS certificate, which can take a few "
"minutes. Reopen this tab afterwards. Until then, here is what you'll be able "
"to do with it."
msgstr ""
"Smarter crea entonces su host y su certificado TLS, lo que puede tardar unos "
"minutos. Vuelve a abrir esta pestaña después. Mientras tanto, esto es lo que "
"podrás hacer con él."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx
msgid "Back to the workbench"
msgstr "Volver al área de trabajo"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "Where to go from here?"
msgstr "¿Y ahora qué?"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid "How this url works"
msgstr "Cómo funciona esta url"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid "Under the hood"
msgstr "Por dentro"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid ""
"Smarter Chat sends this url two kinds of requests, and so can your own code. "
"Both are POST requests, with JSON in and JSON out. Copy a command into a "
"terminal to try it."
msgstr ""
"Smarter Chat envía dos tipos de solicitudes a esta url, y tu propio código "
"también puede hacerlo. Ambas son solicitudes POST, con JSON de entrada y "
"JSON de salida. Copia un comando en una terminal para probarlo."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid ""
"This LLMClient requires a Smarter api key: replace <YOUR-API-KEY> with yours."
msgstr ""
"Este LLMClient requiere una clave de API de Smarter: reemplaza <YOUR-API-"
"KEY> por la tuya."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid "starts a chat"
msgstr "inicia un chat"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid ""
"It returns the LLMClient's configuration, such as its name, welcome message, "
"example prompts and colors, and a session_key for the new chat."
msgstr ""
"Devuelve la configuración del LLMClient, como su nombre, mensaje de "
"bienvenida, prompts de ejemplo y colores, y un session_key para el nuevo "
"chat."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid "sends a prompt"
msgstr "envía un prompt"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid ""
"It returns the messages that the prompt added to the chat. Send the "
"session_key with every prompt, and Smarter keeps the chat's history."
msgstr ""
"Devuelve los mensajes que el prompt añadió al chat. Envía el session_key con "
"cada prompt, y Smarter conserva el historial del chat."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid "Answers are Markdown"
msgstr "Las respuestas son Markdown"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid ""
"The response is JSON, and the assistant's message in it is Markdown. Smarter "
"Chat renders it, with code highlighting, math and diagrams. In your own "
"front end, use any Markdown library."
msgstr ""
"La respuesta es JSON, y el mensaje del asistente que contiene es Markdown. "
"Smarter Chat lo renderiza, con resaltado de código, matemáticas y diagramas. "
"En tu propio front end, usa cualquier biblioteca de Markdown."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid "Secrets stay on the server"
msgstr "Los secretos se quedan en el servidor"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid ""
"Smarter calls the LLM and runs the tools. Their api keys and credentials "
"never reach the browser."
msgstr ""
"Smarter llama al LLM y ejecuta las herramientas. Sus claves de API y "
"credenciales nunca llegan al navegador."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid ""
"The chat's configuration, and a new chat session, whose session_key "
"continues the chat in later prompts."
msgstr ""
"La configuración del chat, y una nueva sesión de chat, cuyo session_key "
"continúa el chat en los prompts siguientes."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid ""
"Sends the LLMClient's first example prompt, and returns the LLM's response."
msgstr ""
"Envía el primer prompt de ejemplo del LLMClient, y devuelve la respuesta del "
"LLM."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid "Sends a prompt, and returns the LLM's response."
msgstr "Envía un prompt, y devuelve la respuesta del LLM."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid "The response, abbreviated:"
msgstr "La respuesta, abreviada:"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid "Things to ask it"
msgstr "Cosas que puedes preguntarle"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ManifestSection.tsx
msgid "How it was built"
msgstr "Cómo se construyó"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ManifestSection.tsx
msgid "Designed in the workbench. Declared in YAML."
msgstr "Diseñado en el área de trabajo. Declarado en YAML."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ManifestSection.tsx
msgid ""
"%(app_name)s was designed, tested and debugged in the Prompt Engineer's "
"Workbench of the Smarter web console, and is deployed from a manifest: a "
"short YAML file that declares everything it is. Change the manifest, apply "
"it, and the url answers with your changes."
msgstr ""
"%(app_name)s se diseñó, probó y depuró en el área de trabajo del ingeniero "
"de prompts de la consola web de Smarter, y se implementa a partir de un "
"manifiesto: un breve archivo YAML que declara todo lo que es. Cambia el "
"manifiesto, aplícalo, y la url responde con tus cambios."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ManifestSection.tsx
msgid ""
"Declarative: the manifest says what the LLMClient is, and Smarter makes it "
"so."
msgstr ""
"Declarativo: el manifiesto dice qué es el LLMClient, y Smarter lo hace "
"realidad."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ManifestSection.tsx
msgid ""
"Version controlled: keep manifests in git, review them in pull requests, "
"apply them from CI."
msgstr ""
"Con control de versiones: guarda los manifiestos en git, revísalos en pull "
"requests, aplícalos desde CI."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ManifestSection.tsx
msgid ""
"Two commands from a YAML file to a live api with its own host and TLS "
"certificate."
msgstr ""
"Dos comandos para pasar de un archivo YAML a una api en línea con su propio "
"host y certificado TLS."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ManifestSection.tsx
msgid "Open it in the workbench"
msgstr "Ábrelo en el área de trabajo"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ManifestSection.tsx
msgid "LLMClient docs"
msgstr "Documentación de LLMClient"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ManifestSection.tsx
msgid ""
"This LLMClient's manifest, as smarter describe llmclient returns it, without "
"its owner's username. Its status is what Smarter reports about it, and is "
"read-only."
msgstr ""
"El manifiesto de este LLMClient, tal como lo devuelve smarter describe "
"llmclient, sin el nombre de usuario de su propietario. Su status es lo que "
"Smarter informa sobre él, y es de solo lectura."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "This LLMClient isn't yours"
msgstr "Este LLMClient no es tuyo"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"%(name)s belongs to %(owner)s, who shares it with you. You can chat with it, "
"read its manifest and use everything on this page that only reads it, but "
"only its owner, or an admin of its account, can change it, deploy it or "
"attach an api key to it. That leaves you two choices."
msgstr ""
"%(name)s pertenece a %(owner)s, que lo comparte contigo. Puedes chatear con "
"él, leer su manifiesto y usar todo lo de esta página que solo lo lee, pero "
"solo su propietario, o un administrador de su cuenta, puede cambiarlo, "
"desplegarlo o asociarle una clave de api. Eso te deja dos opciones."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "1. Leave it as it is"
msgstr "1. Déjalo como está"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"Use it as an example. Chat with it, read its manifest, and borrow whatever "
"you like for LLMClients of your own. Nothing that you do here changes it."
msgstr ""
"Úsalo como ejemplo. Chatea con él, lee su manifiesto y toma lo que quieras "
"para tus propios LLMClients. Nada de lo que hagas aquí lo cambia."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "2. Clone it, and work on your copy"
msgstr "2. Clónalo y trabaja en tu copia"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"A clone is a new LLMClient, owned by you, that starts as an exact copy of "
"this one: the same instructions, LLM provider and model, and the same "
"plugins, MCP clients and guardrails, except any that you aren't allowed to "
"use. It has its own name, and its own url. From then on the two are "
"independent: your changes to the copy never touch the original, and later "
"changes to the original never reach your copy."
msgstr ""
"Un clon es un LLMClient nuevo, de tu propiedad, que empieza como una copia "
"exacta de este: las mismas instrucciones, el mismo proveedor y modelo de "
"LLM, y los mismos plugins, clientes MCP y guardrails, salvo los que no "
"tengas permiso para usar. Tiene su propio nombre y su propia url. A partir "
"de ahí los dos son independientes: tus cambios en la copia nunca tocan el "
"original, y los cambios posteriores del original nunca llegan a tu copia."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "Open the %(list)s list, and its %(tab)s tab."
msgstr "Abre la lista de %(list)s y su pestaña %(tab)s."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-list/src/App.tsx
msgid "Shared LLM Clients"
msgstr "Clientes LLM compartidos"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"Find %(name)s, and click its %(clone)s button, the green icon of two pages."
msgstr ""
"Busca %(name)s y haz clic en su botón %(clone)s, el icono verde de dos "
"páginas."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "Clone"
msgstr "Clonar"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"Type a name for your copy, and click %(ok)s. Smarter writes the name in "
"snake case: %(example)s becomes %(snake_case)s."
msgstr ""
"Escribe un nombre para tu copia y haz clic en %(ok)s. Smarter escribe el "
"nombre en snake case: %(example)s se convierte en %(snake_case)s."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"Your copy appears in the %(your_tab)s tab, under its new name, and the "
"original stays in %(shared_tab)s, unchanged. Open your copy in the "
"workbench, and from there edit its manifest, deploy it, and put it on your "
"site, as this page describes."
msgstr ""
"Tu copia aparece en la pestaña %(your_tab)s, con su nuevo nombre, y el "
"original se queda en %(shared_tab)s, sin cambios. Abre tu copia en el "
"workbench y, desde allí, edita su manifiesto, despliégala y ponla en tu "
"sitio, como describe esta página."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-list/src/App.tsx
msgid "Your LLM Clients"
msgstr "Tus clientes LLM"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "How ownership of Smarter resources works"
msgstr "Cómo funciona la propiedad de los recursos de Smarter"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "who owns a resource, who can read it, and who can change it."
msgstr ""
"quién es el propietario de un recurso, quién puede leerlo y quién puede "
"cambiarlo."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "Your next step"
msgstr "Tu siguiente paso"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"Put %(app_name)s in front of people. Smarter Chat works on any web site, and "
"these integrations are ready to use: pick the one that matches yours. Each "
"of them needs only this LLMClient's url."
msgstr ""
"Pon %(app_name)s frente a la gente. Smarter Chat funciona en cualquier sitio "
"web, y estas integraciones están listas para usar: elige la que corresponda "
"a tu sitio. Cada una solo necesita la url de este LLMClient."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "First, allow your site's origin"
msgstr "Primero, permite el origen de tu sitio"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"Browsers let a page call this url only if the LLMClient's manifest lists the "
"page's origin: its scheme, host and port, without a path. Add your site, and "
"your development server if you have one, then apply the manifest again, in "
"the workbench's Manifest tab or with %(command)s. Skip this, and the chat "
"fails in the browser with a CORS error."
msgstr ""
"Los navegadores solo permiten que una página llame a esta url si el "
"manifiesto del LLMClient incluye el origen de la página: su esquema, host y "
"puerto, sin ruta. Añade tu sitio, y tu servidor de desarrollo si tienes uno, "
"y luego vuelve a aplicar el manifiesto, en la pestaña Manifiesto del área de "
"trabajo o con %(command)s. Si te saltas esto, el chat falla en el navegador "
"con un error de CORS."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"A plugin: a chat launcher on every page, a Smarter Chat block, and a "
"[smarter_chat] shortcode."
msgstr ""
"Un plugin: un lanzador de chat en cada página, un bloque Smarter Chat y un "
"shortcode [smarter_chat]."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"Download smarter-chat-<version>.zip from the plugin's latest release, and "
"upload it in Plugins, Add New, Upload Plugin."
msgstr ""
"Descarga smarter-chat-<version>.zip de la última versión del plugin, y "
"súbelo en Plugins, Añadir nuevo, Subir plugin."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "In Settings, Smarter Chat, enter this LLMClient's url."
msgstr "En Ajustes, Smarter Chat, introduce la url de este LLMClient."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "Guide"
msgstr "Guía"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"A module for Drupal 10.3 and 11: a chat launcher on every page, and a "
"Smarter Chat block for any region."
msgstr ""
"Un módulo para Drupal 10.3 y 11: un lanzador de chat en cada página, y un "
"bloque Smarter Chat para cualquier región."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"Then, in Configuration, Web services, Smarter Chat, enter this LLMClient's "
"url."
msgstr ""
"Luego, en Configuración, Servicios web, Smarter Chat, introduce la url de "
"este LLMClient."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"A theme app extension: a chat launcher on every page, and a Smarter Chat "
"block for any section."
msgstr ""
"Una extensión de app de tema: un lanzador de chat en cada página, y un "
"bloque Smarter Chat para cualquier sección."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"Deploy the extension as your store's own app, from a Shopify Partner "
"account, and install it on your store."
msgstr ""
"Implementa la extensión como la app propia de tu tienda, desde una cuenta de "
"Shopify Partner, e instálala en tu tienda."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"In the theme editor, turn on App embeds, Smarter Chat launcher, and enter "
"this LLMClient's url."
msgstr ""
"En el editor de temas, activa Incrustaciones de app, Smarter Chat launcher, "
"e introduce la url de este LLMClient."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"Allow both of your store's origins: its myshopify.com domain, and its own "
"domain."
msgstr ""
"Permite los dos orígenes de tu tienda: su dominio myshopify.com y su propio "
"dominio."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "React, from npm"
msgstr "React, desde npm"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"%(package)s, the component that the workbench uses, for a React 19 "
"application built with Vite, webpack or Next.js."
msgstr ""
"%(package)s, el componente que usa el área de trabajo, para una aplicación "
"React 19 construida con Vite, webpack o Next.js."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "Any web page, in html"
msgstr "Cualquier página web, en html"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"One script tag, with no build: for a static site, a server-rendered page, "
"Squarespace, Wix or Webflow. Paste it before </body>, and a chat button "
"appears in a corner of the page."
msgstr ""
"Una etiqueta script, sin build: para un sitio estático, una página "
"renderizada en el servidor, Squarespace, Wix o Webflow. Pégala antes de </"
"body>, y aparece un botón de chat en una esquina de la página."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"The chat renders in its own Shadow DOM, so your site's css can't break it. "
"To put it inside the page instead of a launcher, add %(element)s where it "
"goes."
msgstr ""
"El chat se renderiza en su propio Shadow DOM, así que el css de tu sitio no "
"puede romperlo. Para ponerlo dentro de la página en lugar de un lanzador, "
"añade %(element)s donde vaya."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "Something else?"
msgstr "¿Algo más?"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"Google Tag Manager, and documentation sites built with Docusaurus, MkDocs, "
"Sphinx or VitePress, have integrations too. Or build your own front end on "
"this url's api, below, or with the Python, Node.js and Go SDKs."
msgstr ""
"Google Tag Manager, y los sitios de documentación construidos con "
"Docusaurus, MkDocs, Sphinx o VitePress, también tienen integraciones. O "
"construye tu propio front end sobre la api de esta url, más abajo, o con los "
"SDK de Python, Node.js y Go."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "Docs sites"
msgstr "Sitios de documentación"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "SDKs"
msgstr "SDK"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid "Give it to Smarter Chat"
msgstr "Dásela a Smarter Chat"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid ""
"Smarter Chat sends the key with every request, as %(header)s. The WordPress, "
"Drupal and Shopify integrations have an api key setting. In html, add %"
"(attribute)s:"
msgstr ""
"Smarter Chat envía la clave con cada solicitud, como %(header)s. Las "
"integraciones de WordPress, Drupal y Shopify tienen un ajuste para la clave "
"de API. En html, añade %(attribute)s:"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid ""
"In React, pass apiKey, from your build's environment rather than from your "
"source code:"
msgstr ""
"En React, pasa apiKey, desde el entorno de tu build y no desde tu código "
"fuente:"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid ""
"An api key belongs to a staff user of your account, and a platform "
"administrator creates it with this command. The command prints the key's "
"name, and its secret, once: store the secret somewhere safe, such as a "
"password manager or your hosting's secrets."
msgstr ""
"Una clave de API pertenece a un usuario staff de tu cuenta, y un "
"administrador de la plataforma la crea con este comando. El comando muestra "
"el nombre de la clave y su secreto, una sola vez: guarda el secreto en un "
"lugar seguro, como un gestor de contraseñas o los secretos de tu hosting."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid ""
"The web console's API Keys page lists your keys, and turns a key off without "
"deleting it."
msgstr ""
"La página Claves de API de la consola web lista tus claves, y desactiva una "
"clave sin eliminarla."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid ""
"Name the key in the LLMClient's manifest, and apply the manifest again, in "
"the workbench's Manifest tab or with %(command)s. From then on, every "
"request to the url needs the key, and this page says \"Api key required\"."
msgstr ""
"Nombra la clave en el manifiesto del LLMClient, y vuelve a aplicar el "
"manifiesto, en la pestaña Manifiesto del área de trabajo o con %(command)s. "
"A partir de entonces, cada solicitud a la url necesita la clave, y esta "
"página dice \"Requiere clave de API\"."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid ""
"To replace a key, create a new one, name it in the manifest instead, and "
"apply it: Smarter detaches the old key. Then turn the old key off."
msgstr ""
"Para reemplazar una clave, crea una nueva, nómbrala en el manifiesto en su "
"lugar, y aplícalo: Smarter desvincula la clave anterior. Luego desactiva la "
"clave anterior."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid "Api keys"
msgstr "Claves de API"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid ""
"This LLMClient already requires an api key: the url answers only requests "
"that carry one of its keys. Here is how to give a key to a front end in "
"production, and how to replace one."
msgstr ""
"Este LLMClient ya requiere una clave de API: la url solo responde a las "
"solicitudes que llevan una de sus claves. Así es como se da una clave a un "
"front end en producción, y cómo se reemplaza."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid ""
"Right now, anyone who has this url can chat with it, and every prompt is "
"charged to its owner. Attach an api key, and the url answers only requests "
"that carry it. The workbench keeps working, with your login."
msgstr ""
"Ahora mismo, cualquiera que tenga esta url puede chatear con él, y cada "
"prompt se cobra a su propietario. Vincula una clave de API, y la url solo "
"responderá a las solicitudes que la lleven. El área de trabajo sigue "
"funcionando, con tu sesión."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid "You can do it right here."
msgstr "Puedes hacerlo aquí mismo."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid "A key in a web page is not a secret"
msgstr "Una clave en una página web no es un secreto"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid ""
"Anyone who opens the page can read the key in its source, and use it from "
"anywhere. On a public site, a key limits who can call the url, rather than "
"hiding it, so combine it with the rest:"
msgstr ""
"Cualquiera que abra la página puede leer la clave en su código fuente, y "
"usarla desde cualquier lugar. En un sitio público, una clave limita quién "
"puede llamar a la url, en lugar de ocultarla, así que combínala con lo demás:"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid "give each site a key of its own, and turn it off if it is abused;"
msgstr "da a cada sitio su propia clave, y desactívala si se abusa de ella;"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid ""
"list only your site's origins in allowedOrigins, which browsers enforce;"
msgstr ""
"incluye solo los orígenes de tu sitio en allowedOrigins, que los navegadores "
"hacen cumplir;"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid "give the LLMClient a budget, which caps what its prompts can cost."
msgstr ""
"asigna un presupuesto al LLMClient, que limita lo que pueden costar sus "
"prompts."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid ""
"For an internal tool, or a server-to-server integration, keep the key on "
"your server, and call this url from there."
msgstr ""
"Para una herramienta interna, o una integración de servidor a servidor, "
"guarda la clave en tu servidor, y llama a esta url desde allí."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SmarterProject.tsx
msgid "The Smarter Project"
msgstr "The Smarter Project"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SmarterProject.tsx
msgid "Build your own LLM applications"
msgstr "Construye tus propias aplicaciones LLM"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SmarterProject.tsx
msgid "Prompt Engineer's Workbench"
msgstr "Área de trabajo del ingeniero de prompts"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SmarterProject.tsx
msgid ""
